xJU++C2QNElCJ05njmAuTXynXh/VITf7+YIB5R62G3vLsud\nOdqiDhO2JCkIrajeL3svbhGO+T9kEgQT833nwOUxKudsXCcJQvRgymlBEZeS\nRgeTpYHpTuamMSQe6CeS5dXmBy7bJCU7uUOn1OsNJ0aDbU3fRXFKOV8K8lOy\nxfC38UC4bmmOFEiLGX9QniWiksQon0YVqc/ulA41g67IyoZgJIO/kqihGfSd\nYaB9KAnp8ajBf10D\n",
    "long_instructions": "## Displaying Medication Data\r\n\r\nYour overall task is to use the data **schema** you planned to populate and display data for three medication reminders on the screen.\r\n\r\n1.  **Update HTML and CSS:** Upload the picture of your schema and work with AI to update the `index.html` and `style.css` files. Ensure they contain the structure and styling for the fields you want to display based on your medication schema (e.g., Name, Dosage, Time).\r\n\r\n2.  **Define Parallel Arrays (Data):** In your `script.js` file, define three or more **parallel arrays** (lists) that hold your medication data.\r\n    * Each array must have at least three items.\r\n    * **Critical:** The item at the same **index** (e.g., index `[0]`) across all arrays must belong to the same single medication reminder.\r\n    * *Example:* Define `const medNames = [\"...\", \"...\", \"...\"];`\r\n\r\n3.  **Manually Wire the Data (JavaScript):** Complete the empty `updateDisplay` function in `script.js`. Write code that uses **manual indexing** to assign array values to the correct HTML element.\r\n    * *Tip: Remember to use the `+` operator to combine descriptive text like \"Dosage: \" with the array value.*\r\n\r\n    * **Card 1:** Use the DOM variables for Card 1 (e.g., `name1`) and access the data at array **index `[0]`** (e.g., `medNames[0]`).\r\n    * **Card 2:** Use the DOM variables for Card 2 (e.g., `name2`) and access the data at array **index `[1]`**.\r\n    * **Card 3:** Use the DOM variables for Card 3 (e.g., `name3`) and access the data at array **index `[2]`**.\r\n\r\n4.  **Test:** Run your code. The three medication cards in the preview should now correctly display the specific name, dosage, and time data you defined in your arrays.",
    "bubble_choice_description": "Display your schema information on the Medication Reminder app.",
    "display_name": "Medication Reminder",
